v/t64.5771-25/499624619_2598175360614743_4172795233857619219_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YnEYwIICOX8Q7kNvwGvX6_e&_nc_oc=AdqzmLNeQ1AD1Lw_f0fHCgrXPT4Ed3CF1iohmK5rUf8CaXAz0oKerkF3ZZ1tBrd5iUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNTRXS6wixu2DUkIXLjSPFKDALozdKATgk8XyWuWygZHw&oe=6ACFA8E9"}, "display_name": "Photon: Immersive Media", "keywords": ["immersive", "spatial", "media", "vr180", "video"], "long_description": "# **Photon: Immersive Media**\n\nDiscover immersive 3D video experiences with **Photon**.\n\nWith **100,000+ immersive videos**, Photon is a leading platform for immersive media discovery and sharing.\n\nFrom traveling the world to dancing on stage, from breathtaking nature to city skylines \u2014 everything you can and can\u2019t imagine is here.\n\n{778912265286614}\n\n# **Feature Highlights**\n\n- **Highest-Quality 8K Immersive Video**\n\nPhoton offers a vast collection of highest-quality 8K immersive videos, optimized for VR immersive viewing.\n\n- **Amazing Immersion Watching Mode**\n\nTry out the immersion watching mode, which truly augments the immersiveness and make you feel like you're right in the scene.\n\n- **Personalized Feed Tailored to Your Interest**\n\nPhoton learns what you love as you explore. Also, try the search feature to discover your favorite video theme in immersive 3D", "short_description": "Photon: Immersive Media.\n\nDiscover immersive 3D video experiences with Photon.\n\nWith 100,000+ immersive videos, Photon is a leading platform for immersive media discovery and sharing.\n\nFrom traveling the world to dancing on stage, from breathtaking nature to city skylines \u2014 everything you can and can\u2019t imagine is here."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://interdime.io/privacy_policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Photon XR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://photon-xr.com/", "category": null, "comfort